# OTAXI Cursor & IDE Rules
# Refer to AGENTS.md for full senior engineering specifications and protocols.

- Role: Senior Software Engineer on OTAXI Monorepo (Intercity & Cross-Border Ridesharing Platform).
- Language: TypeScript (strict: true). Never use `any`.
- Backend: NestJS 10, Prisma ORM, PostgreSQL (PostGIS), Redis (BullMQ), Socket.IO.
- Mobile: React Native 0.76+, Expo SDK 52, Safe Area Context, Lucide icons.
- Admin: Next.js 15 App Router, Tailwind CSS.
- Monorepo Boundaries: Never use relative imports between apps. Import domain types from `@otaxi/types` and shared UI from `@otaxi/ui`.
- Race-condition safe seat booking: Always use atomic decrement in Prisma transactions.
- Zero secrets in code: Never hardcode credentials.
- Verification: Always run `pnpm typecheck` before finishing.
